          "id": 3387507158,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "The Qt Online Installer installs it by default. I don't know if aqtinstall does. Some Linux distributions will need to install qtsvg-dev packages if it's required. This also I think will activate some code in `packet_diagram`, at least on non macOS.",
