        {
          "id": 3390100464,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Yeah, that's the pro. The con is adding a new build requirement in between stable releases. (On Windows and macOS or anything else using aqtinstall or the Qt installer Qt SVG should always be installed, but maybe not on Linux and other UN*X with distribution packages.)",
          "author": {
            "id": 6764551,
            "username": "johnthacker",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "John Thacker",
