        {
          "id": 3390952755,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "The Fedora, Debian/Ubuntu, Arch, and Alpine 4.6 packages explicitly require QtSvg. The FreeBSD package doesn't, but it will be present if another port requires it. It might make sense add QtSvg as an optional component in the 4.6 branch; this would Windows and macOS builds will pick it up while keeping complexity to a minimum.",
